---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { TEKST } from "../../config";

const t = TEKST.en;
const beschrijving =
  "ISO 27001 for a Dutch SaaS, IT or MSP firm. I turn a customer demand into a system an internal audit can follow. I never certify my own work.";
---

<Base titel={t.kop} beschrijving={beschrijving} taal="en" lees>
  <h1>{t.kop}</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    I help Dutch software and IT firms turn enterprise security and privacy
    requirements into an auditable system, and I never certify my own work.
    The person who implements is never the internal auditor for the same client.
  </p>

  <h2>Who it is for</h2>
  <p>
    A Dutch B2B SaaS firm, IT provider or MSP, about 10 to 80 people. The
    buyer is the founder, the COO, or the first person hired for security.
  </p>

  <h2>The trigger</h2>
  <p>
    An enterprise customer, or a tender, requires ISO 27001 or a completed
    security questionnaire by a date.
  </p>

  <h2>What I do and what I do not do</h2>
  <p>
    I do the gap scan or the security questionnaire, an independent internal
    audit (not a certification audit), or the implementation. I never certify
    my own work. The person who implements is never the internal auditor for
    the same client. I do not issue a certificate, I do not judge the statute,
    and I do not issue an accountant's report.
  </p>
  <p>
    NIS2 supplier evidence can later rest on the same system. It is not a
    second offer.
  </p>

  <p><a class="knop" href="/en/contact/">{t.cta}</a></p>
  <p><a href="/en/over/">The limits are on About.</a></p>
</Base>
